@startuml forms-vol04-flow
title Sample flow - pharmacy stock and supply (volume 4)
autonumber

participant "Ward / dept" as W
participant "Facility\npharmacy" as PH
participant "Supplier" as SUP

PH -> PH : 131 monthly need by treatment standards & bed-count\n(standing commission)
PH -> SUP : procurement order
SUP -> PH : delivery
PH -> PH : 132 quantitative receipt, 137 stock accounting
W -> PH : 134 requisition (waybill)
PH -> W : 136 drugs issued to departments
PH -> PH : 135/139 daily expense, 138/140 turnover statements,\n141 balance

note over PH
  Inventory and accounting, not patient-level clinical data;
  largely out of initial clinical-integration scope.
end note
@enduml
